# ---- build outputs / caches ----
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/.kotlin/
AndroidClient/webview-app/local.properties
AndroidClient/vendor/roBrowserLegacy/node_modules/
AndroidClient/vendor/roBrowserLegacy/dist/
